## How to Customize

### Customizing Layout & Styling

Edit `server/printSlipConfig.ts` to change any aspect:

```typescript
// Example: Change title text and size
title: {
  text: 'YOUR CUSTOM TITLE',  // Change this
  fontSize: 16,               // Make larger
  fontWeight: 'bold',
  color: '#0066cc',          // Change color
  marginBottom: 4,           // Add more space
  textAlign: 'center',
},

// Example: Change slip dimensions for different paper
slip: {
  width: 100,               // 100mm × 150mm instead
  height: 150,
  padding: 4,               // Less padding
  margin: 1,
},

// Example: Add more fields
fields: [
  {
    label: 'Custom Field',
    dataKey: 'YOUR_FIELD_NAME',  // Must match voter object keys
    fontSize: 10,
    fontWeight: 'normal',
    labelWidth: 30,
    marginBottom: 2,
    marginLeft: 3,
    showLabel: true,
  },
  // ... existing fields ...
]
```

### Common Customizations

**1. Change Paper Size**
```typescript
// For smaller slips (50mm × 75mm each)
slip: {
  width: 50,
  height: 75,
  padding: 2,
  margin: 1,
},

// Adjust font sizes accordingly
fields: [
  { ..., fontSize: 8 },  // Smaller fonts
  { ..., fontSize: 7 },
],
```

**2. Change Font/Language Support**
```typescript
font: {
  family: 'Hindi, Devanagari, Arial, sans-serif',  // Add more fonts
  baseSize: 11,
},
```

**3. Add/Remove Fields**
```typescript
fields: [
  { label: 'Name', dataKey: 'Name', ... },
  { label: 'Epic No', dataKey: 'epic_no', ... },
  // Remove any field by commenting out or deleting
  // { label: 'Ward', dataKey: 'ward', ... },
],
```

**4. Change Colors**
```typescript
slip: {
  backgroundColor: '#f0f0f0',    // Gray background
  borderColor: '#333333',         // Dark border
},

title: {
  color: '#c41e3a',              // Red color
},

footer: {
  color: '#666666',
  borderTopColor: '#cccccc',
},
```

**5. Multi-Column Layout**
```typescript
fields: [
  {
    label: 'Age',
    dataKey: 'Age',
    columnsInLine: 2,  // 2 fields per line
    // ... other settings ...
  },
  {
    label: 'Gender',
    dataKey: 'Gender',
    columnsInLine: 2,  // This appears next to Age
    // ... other settings ...
  },
]
```

---

## Voter Data Fields Available

The following fields are automatically available from MongoDB voter records:

```javascript
{
  _id: ObjectId,
  Name: 'string',
  'Father Name': 'string',
  'Husband Name': 'string',
  Gender: 'string',
  Age: number,
  epic_no: 'string',
  booth: 'string',
  ward: 'string',
  // ... other fields from your MongoDB schema ...
}
```

**Special Handling:**
- For "Relation" field: Automatically uses `Father Name` first, falls back to `Husband Name`
- Missing fields: Display "-" in the slip
- All field values are converted to strings automatically

