## Testing the Print Feature

### Frontend (React)
1. Go to **Home Page** → Search for a voter
2. Click **Print Button** on any voter card
3. PDF should download automatically

### Command Line (for testing)
```bash
# Generate print slip for a voter
curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/voters/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011/print \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN" \
  -o voter-slip.pdf
```

