## File Structure

```
server/
├── printSlipConfig.ts       # ⚙️ Configuration (main customization file)
├── printSlipGenerator.ts    # 🎨 HTML generation from config
├── pdfService.ts            # 📄 PDF generation via Puppeteer
├── routes.ts                # 🔌 API endpoint handler (UPDATED)
└── ...

public/uploads/             # 📦 Temporary PDF storage
└── slip-*.pdf              # Auto-cleaned up after download
```

